			"notes": "**Features**\n- Added blackbird/raven emote for cacti\n- Chat Compacter\n- Chat Copy\n- Cookie blocker (enabled by default, requires cookie in slot 5 to use)\n- Egg value HUD (shows if egg is in inventory, and you are in crates, trade or PV)\n- Hide worldedit-style TP command suggestions if not enabled\n- Slot Locking\n- Visibility Keybinds\n\n**Improvements / QoL**\n- Added a few more shortcut commands (`/vm` for visit masterplaysxd, `/pv` for pvs, `/lh` for lobby housing, housing suggestion arg for `/lobby`, `/po` for potsoff, `/dur` for potdur)\n- Added events to timers\n- Added gh % to timers\n- Added suggestion of online players for `/msg`\n- Changed Petad Ready to green, shortened to just `Ready`, and added `Inactive`\n- Improved warp helper, potsoff and pets clicks \n- Made pots only show highest active time\n- Massive timer overhaul\n- Removed Il's restock timer (more annoying than useful at this point)\n- Added new warps to warp helper\n\n**Bug Fixes**\n- Fix custom scoreboard not having a clamp (moving off screen when resized)\n     - this fix may require you to move it around slightly in `/mstu edithud` (can return to og pos)\n- Fix forcetablist to make it populate with correct people instead of just players already listed\n- Fix HELPER not being resolved (also added more future proofing for that)\n- Fix null entry causing crash for midnight\n- Fixed numbers being shortened before being converted into time format\n- Fix space warrior's perk from doing weird stuff when overflowing\n- Made emotes not overlap with ones that go into Minecraft chat by default (so stuff appears as intended)\n- Updater no longer bugs you if you're on a prerelease\n- Hide Hypixel ranks now works as a standalone toggle\n\n**Partially Done / Notes**\n- Added base flare value for selling — intend on redoing still"
		},
