			"notes": "## New:\n- /swarp will now open /warp\n- Some HUDs for the plasma forge (and flare value when in ore bag), open to any suggestions it is pretty basic info currently\n     \n## Improvements/Fixes:\n- Ore Tracker now adds raven's double drops (as long as i was given the correct msg)\n- Wiki exporter now exports armor/skulls slot as <Display Name>.png (ignore this, this is basically only for me)      \n- Fixed typo in PvE tracker making it not render in T5 PvE\n\n.\n\n### Staff stuff:\n- World Edit style mobility commands (MST Staff only or when on your own house, it uses /tp)  \n     - `/thru` - go through walls \n     - `/ceil` - teleport to directly below the ceiling\n     - `/ascend #` - teleport that many levels\n     - `/desc #` and `/descend #` - decsend that many levels\n     - `/j`  and `/jumpto` - teleport on top of the block you're currently looking at\n     - `/top` - teleport to the highest block at your current pos"
		},
