			"notes": "- Added ability to hover over :shortcode: emote suggestions to see a emote preview \n- Made all HUDs other than Info hud require being on MST to render (will not render in other houses, gamemodes, etc.)\n- Changed \"System\" glyph with the `BUTTON` theme to say \"Bridge\"\n- Added an exporter for wiki\n     - This will allow you to set a keybind and export the contents of the GUI you're looking inside of or item you're hovering over into a format ready to be pasted into MST Wiki. Note: Player heads when exported will attempt to use <Display Name>.png -- If not added please source the image yourself matching all other playerskulls or use wikirender to do it easier. Please read any relevant info on wiki before uploading and know what you are doing"
